        "Description": "Suppose there are two canned juice vending machines, two things you really want. Sometimes you are not sure which one you want to drink, hot coffee or oolong tea. In such a case, you press both buttons at the same time like this. Then, subconsciously, you press the one you really want first...well, try it. Speaking of choosing between two buttons...",
